  "_about": "Design tokens for 8086Studio. emu8086 is a Windows-grey/blue Win32 app; our hue family is emerald green, clearly not blue. Roles are stable (replica-design set them); values are ours. Run `python3 contrast.py tokens.json` after every palette change.",
